  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SOM: CSSF CTPF Somaliland - Counter Terrorism Capacity Building and Training</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Somaliland CTPF Capacity Building &amp; Training Programme builds on the long-standing UK support to the Somaliland security forces in the field of counter-terrorism. The project aims to improve the effectiveness of Somaliland in thwarting the activities of Al Shabaab (AS) and IS-Somalia (IS-S), through capacity-building, high-level engagements, and judicial diplomacy.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to: 
- support development of a Somaliland-led capability that disrupts AS/IS operations and planning, through improved capabilities; 
- improve intelligence sharing  through increase internal cooperation and the effective intelligence sharing mechanisms. and
 - increase the quality of CT investigations and prosecutions, as the prosecutorial evidence benefits from greater use of Somaliland&#x2019;s own resources, as well as strengthen the CT legislative framework.</narrative>
  </description>
